  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Morocco anti-corruption</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the proposed cooperation is to contribute to making Moroccan government institutions more accessible, transparent and accountable by a focus on combating corruption and promoting integrity in these institutions, through dedicated trainings to high and mid level policy makers.Also, this project will foster bilateral relations between Morocco and the Netherlands on the level of representatives of government and (knowledge) institutes from both countries.</narrative>
  </description>
